title: 방향키엔딩_영문
---
Right now, I'm having a meal with NaHyun.
I think she was telling me a story about her high school days,
Wait... since when was it?
It seems like NaHyun has stopped talking.
{name()}: ...Why did you stop?
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: {name()}, you're not even listening to me, are you?
{name()}: W-what? No, I'm listening...
(NaHyun cuts me off.)
NaHyun: You're always like this. I refuse to waste another moment dining with a silent statue.
{name()}: ......
(I want to make an excuse, but I feel like NaHyun might actually kill me if I open my mouth again......)
With a chilling silence between us, we finished our meal without saying a word.
<<hide>>
As soon as she finished eating, NaHyun stood up and left the table.
ASan: Oh boy. 
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: To think thou wouldst dare to pluck the whiskers of a sleeping cat...
Before I knew it, ASan appeared behind me, clicking her tongue, and stood by my side.
{name()}: Wouldn't it be a lion?
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: I know that!!!!! And NaHyun is a CAAAAAAT!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
ASan: I knew this would happen. {name()}, thou must be punished.
{name()}: What are you talking about? What did I even do wrong?
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: To one who cannot even reflect upon oneself, this humble servant has nothing more to say...
ASan: I didst tell thee that one must give their utmost heart when trying to win a lady's favor...
<<hide>>
ASan disappeared after rambling on with those absurd words.
EunPyo: {name()}!! Seriously, why did you do that?
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: {name()}, you never really listened to what we said, did you? You always just brushed us off.
EunPyo: That's why this is happening.
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: We... we wanted you to truly connect with us...
EunPyo: We wanted to see "REAL" you, but you never showed it to us.
EunPyo: You know what I mean, right?
//EunPyo: You brushed us off {방향키누른횟수} times...
{name()}: ......
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: If there's a next time, try harder.
EunPyo also vanishes after leaving me with those cryptic words......
Was I too hasty......?
<<end>>
===